(1) D = 3, eta = 2, non-diagonal metric, 3 rational points: residuals ['0', '0', '0'] -> IDENTITY HOLDS
(1) D = 4, eta = 3/2, diagonal metric, 2 rational points: residuals ['0', '0'] -> IDENTITY HOLDS
    general D (by hand, checked above at D = 3, 4): eta = (D-1)/(D-2), ghat = N^(2/(D-2)) g, N -> e^((2-D) w) N under g -> e^(2w) g
(2) N sqrt(g) |a|^3 = 27 sqrt(ghat) |d psi|^3, psi = N^(1/3): residuals ['0', '0', '0'] -> HOLDS
(3) the scale of a0 as a length and a time, and the locality ratio on the 6e10 Msun point mass:
    canonical: c^2/a0 = 31.12 Gpc, c/a0 = 101.5 Gyr, v_f = 165.2 km/s, c^2/v_f^2 = 3.292e+06 (log10 6.517); against 4 pi: 2.62e+05
    alt: c^2/a0 = 25.75 Gpc, c/a0 = 84.0 Gyr, v_f = 173.2 km/s, c^2/v_f^2 = 2.995e+06 (log10 6.476); against 4 pi: 2.38e+05
